#H
#C(168,005)|Item Bonuses|
#F015
#L(016,050)|There are 5 types of item bonuses in the game:|
#F007
#L(016,075)|Battle - This adds directly to the strength|
#L(016,095)|of the hero carrying it.|
#F015
#L(016,120)|Command - This adds not only to the hero|
#L(016,140)|carrying the item, but to every other army|
#L(016,160)|stacked with him.|
#F007
#L(016,185)|Movement - doubles the movement of every unit|
#L(016,205)|stacked with that hero at the start of turn.|
#F015
#L(016,230)|Flying - Turn the hero's stack into a unit of|
#L(016,250)|flying armies.|
#F007
#L(016,275)|Gold - adds an amount of gold to your income|
#L(016,295)|for each city you own.|
#E

